   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Combobox\n\nA searchable select: the panel opens, a query types itself, the list narrows, and the matching row is picked.\n\nCategory: ui. Length: 4 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- Showing a searchable, filterable dropdown with a typed query narrowing the list.\n- Demoing autocomplete or type-ahead selection in a product walkthrough.\n- A form field needs a constrained set of options with search.\n\nAvoid when:\n- The list is not filterable and selection is direct: use select.\n- The overlay is a command palette with icons and shortcuts: use command-menu.\n- The input is free-form text with no list: use input.\n\nVariables:\n- query (string): Query, default \"ba\"\n- placeholder (string): Placeholder, default \"Select a fruit\\u2026\"\n- items (string): Items, default \"[\\\"Apple\\\", \\\"Banana\\\", \\\"Orange\\\", \\\"Grape\\\"]\"\n- mode (enum): Mode, default \"light\"\n- speed (number, 0.25-4): Speed, default 1\n- transparent (boolean): Transparent, default false\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
